+ *
+ * gsth265encoder.h: generic H.265 encoder base class, derived from the H.264
+ * encoder base class (gsth264encoder.h). It drives the generic GOP / reference
+ * picture / POC management and delegates the codec-specific parameter-set and
+ * bitstream work (VPS/SPS/PPS, slice headers) to the subclass via vmethods.
+ *
+ * This library is free software; you can redistribute it and/or
+ * modify it under the terms of the GNU Library General Public
